          "content": "=**Meeting Agenda**\n\n- **Meeting Date & Time:** {{ $json.startRaw }}\n- **gCal ID:** {{ $json.gcalId }}\n- **gCal Link:** {{ $json.gcalLink }}\n- **Meeting Link:** {{ $json.meetingLink || 'n/a' }}\n- **Attendee Emails:** {{ $json.attendeeEmails || 'none' }}\n- **Attendee Email Domains:** {{ $json.attendeeDomains || 'none' }}\n\n---\n\n## Agenda\n- \n\n## Notes\n- \n\n## Follow-ups\n- ",
